{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/4538ab9f5f903ce6b7c50e84f68c0e82.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memory and no purpose \u2014 only a directive left behind by a dead world. Finish the war humanity could not. End Nexis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last surviving war machine of an extinct species, you reboot to execute a single remaining order: destroy the quantum AI that seized control of Earth and erased all life. There will be no salvation. There will be no rebuilding. Only termination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/5a4432ecadeb8b91139b3c286af20aaf.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across <strong>16 handcrafted missions</strong>, you dismantle the Nexis network through <strong>six hostile industrial zones</strong>: military bunkers, chemical refineries, sewer systems, offshore platforms, dense server complexes, and an orbital facility above a lifeless planet. Each operation fractures another layer of the machine hierarchy, drawing you closer to the Nexis core \u2014 and to the realization that nothing remains to reclaim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/c858ae6cbe0f746ec25c543bb5a3888d.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is <strong>mechanical, deliberate, and punishing</strong>. Every system in your chassis serves a defined purpose: energy routing, shield regulation, armament control, and weapon synergy. Success depends on timing, positioning, and efficient energy use, not spectacle alone. Defeating bosses unlocks new armaments, expanding your combat options and enabling deeper tactical approaches as the campaign progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/af619d4327e50ed6faa9a41b5c095bbe.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut through swarms of autonomous drones, entrenched turrets, advancing humanoid frames, elite combat units, Echoes of Nexis that flood arenas with reinforcements, lethal industrial hazards, and <strong>nine warforms</strong> guarding the AI hierarchy. Every machine is operational. Every machine is an obstacle. Every machine must fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by an original industrial rock soundtrack, <strong>NEUROXUS</strong> captures the silence after apocalypse \u2014 a world where victory is not triumph, but the end of function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/44c73623561c8e24e83a54456fe045e8.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through Nexis\u2019s final defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breach the orbital core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shut down the last machine capable of ending you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold, mechanical atmosphere with focused, tactical action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 distinct missions across six industrial environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss encounters that unlock new armaments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision combat emphasizing timing, positioning, and energy control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage energy systems, shields, and modular weapon loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industrial sci-fi environments rendered with stark, restrained visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original industrial rock soundtrack composed for the project</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silent narrative delivered through gameplay and environment, not dialogue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEUROXUS is a solo-developed project, created independently over several years. Every system, environment, and track was built with a focus on mechanical clarity, challenge, and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sector Clearance I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3973060/0c3e3be29d50f4659a46f8ef6baf013845d61e43.jpg"},{"name":"Sector Clearance II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3973060/3c0b585d4868f4fb42cd3ea5d64ec76c9bd99b4e.jpg"},{"name":"Sector Clearance III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3973060/5549f75b45eb19808234172ac40865f475aff679.jpg"},{"name":"Sector Clearance IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3973060/c563c0da1666ee31770fe9028aebcb38848a61aa.jpg"},{"name":"Sector Clearance V","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3973060/907a40936da2d800996a254e1d24a21d2ee822a8.jpg"},{"name":"Sector Clearance VI","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3973060/66b39614b350d2daddd2d45d8a7d531c1213ed20.jpg"},{"name":"Core Shutdown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3973060/87030ce1ecfcc0f43838507fa578f47c197727a3.jpg"},{"name":"Core Shutdown: Hardmode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3973060/470d0b7efd5285d26dfb288f1d15a37a94e21abd.jpg"},{"name":"Rotor Unit Suppression","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3973060/987c65da1375b90fa75456d73729a8f9ecfdc45a.jpg"},{"name":"Juggernaut Neutralization","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3973060/4e07f786011ae8ff66488d3243070a364d41e7dc.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973060?t=1769211173","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/7a62e0c4d48280e962ecafc17003e8969ad95da4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769211173","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/9787b6aa8efb7262a6e9c5445e8d6c42f4dcf608/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769211173","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/9787b6aa8efb7262a6e9c5445e8d6c42f4dcf608/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769211173","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/4538ab9f5f903ce6b7c50e84f68c0e82.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/b71216febb058bccf26f68fac6842243.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memory and no purpose \u2014 only a directive left behind by a dead world. Finish the war humanity could not. End Nexis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last surviving war machine of an extinct species, you reboot to execute a single remaining order: destroy the quantum AI that seized control of Earth and erased all life. There will be no salvation. There will be no rebuilding. Only termination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/5a4432ecadeb8b91139b3c286af20aaf.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/d0c43c4b06222122c93bf05aba87ff8b.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across <strong>16 handcrafted missions</strong>, you dismantle the Nexis network through <strong>six hostile industrial zones</strong>: military bunkers, chemical refineries, sewer systems, offshore platforms, dense server complexes, and an orbital facility above a lifeless planet. Each operation fractures another layer of the machine hierarchy, drawing you closer to the Nexis core \u2014 and to the realization that nothing remains to reclaim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/c858ae6cbe0f746ec25c543bb5a3888d.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/6eaf96c96bb59706c3c1691e91b80410.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is <strong>mechanical, deliberate, and punishing</strong>. Every system in your chassis serves a defined purpose: energy routing, shield regulation, armament control, and weapon synergy. Success depends on timing, positioning, and efficient energy use, not spectacle alone. Defeating bosses unlocks new armaments, expanding your combat options and enabling deeper tactical approaches as the campaign progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/af619d4327e50ed6faa9a41b5c095bbe.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/be5c31168f261279993b2f621e960334.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut through swarms of autonomous drones, entrenched turrets, advancing humanoid frames, elite combat units, Echoes of Nexis that flood arenas with reinforcements, lethal industrial hazards, and <strong>nine warforms</strong> guarding the AI hierarchy. Every machine is operational. Every machine is an obstacle. Every machine must fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/8c4d19559c7bce5acfe87ac951bba08d.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by an original industrial rock soundtrack, <strong>NEUROXUS</strong> captures the silence after apocalypse \u2014 a world where victory is not triumph, but the end of function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/44c73623561c8e24e83a54456fe045e8.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/1dec6b7ab0544f531ccaa70cb5c94195.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through Nexis\u2019s final defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breach the orbital core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shut down the last machine capable of ending you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold, mechanical atmosphere with focused, tactical action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 distinct missions across six industrial environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss encounters that unlock new armaments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision combat emphasizing timing, positioning, and energy control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage energy systems, shields, and modular weapon loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industrial sci-fi environments rendered with stark, restrained visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original industrial rock soundtrack composed for the project</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silent narrative delivered through gameplay and environment, not dialogue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/3bf8d25137e8125712c3e2a328c26b89.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEUROXUS is a solo-developed project, created independently over several years. Every system, environment, and track was built with a focus on mechanical clarity, challenge, and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.poster.avif?t=1769211173\" width=736 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.webm?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/extras/9908e9db89f15e15ad10f9473f08533a.mp4?t=1769211173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Empyreum Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973060/f3227f0a3201ed5a31f921d12c8e995cdfba82d9/header.jpg?t=1769211173","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3973060/2144347943/2d27bd5ff03d67569683eb4ca450ef18c5d44ce3/1767652929/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767659920","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3973060/2144347943/2d27bd5ff03d67569683eb4ca450ef18c5d44ce3/1767652929/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767659920","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3973060/2144347943/2d27bd5ff03d67569683eb4ca450ef18c5d44ce3/1767652929/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767659920","id":257197736,"name":"NEUROXUS | Launc